      "cooked": "<p>Say I have a green ability that says:</p>\n<p>\"Attack up to two targets using Electricity. Also take an amount of damage equal to your Mid die.\"</p>\n<p>This hero also has an inherent yellow ability that says:</p>\n<p>\"If you would take damage from Electricity, reduce that damage to 0 and Recover that amount of Health instead\"</p>\n<p>If this hero was in the yellow zone and used the green ability, would he heal instead of damaging himself?</p>",
